{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 2016,
  "hub_id": 2696,
  "guid": "com.acidphantasm.delayedfleasales",
  "name": "Delayed Flea Sales",
  "slug": "delayed-flea-sales",
  "teaser": "If you are tired of having your flea offers being sold instantly, maybe you don't like money - I don't know, this mod is for you.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2696.png",
  "downloads": 4400,
  "favourites_count": 5,
  "description": "<p>Very simply allows configurable delayed sales for flea offers. If you don’t want instant sales when you sell at average price or lower, then use this mod.</p>\n<p>Adjust the instant sell chance, minimum delayed sale time, and maximum delayed sale time.</p>\n<p>If you don’t want instant sales at all, change that in the config to 0.</p>\n<p>If an offer is marked to sell before the minimum delayed sale time, then it will roll a random time between the minimum and maximum.</p>\n<p><strong>Default Values</strong></p>\n<p>Instant Sell Chance: 25%</p>\n<p>Minimum Sale Time: 60 seconds</p>\n<p>Maximum Sale Time: 900 seconds</p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><hr />\n<ol>\n<li>Download Delayed Flea Sales</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded zip file</li>\n<li>Select the SPT folder in the zip file</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT folder from zip file into your root SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"34vXXDj.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><hr />\n<ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/SPT/user/mods/acidphantasm-delayedfleasales</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n",
  "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2016/delayed-flea-sales",
