      "description": "<h3><strong>This version will only work for SPT 4.0.11+</strong></h3>\n<p>New Features</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Configuration option for the timer used to remove an offer from the flea\n<ul>\n<li>This does not change how often the server checks to send you a mail message on expired offers, it just frees up the slot on the flea if you adjust the timer to be lower. Default value is the default value vanilla.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Bugs Squashed</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Resolved RollForSale patch not returning early if the offer didn’t roll to sell</li>\n</ul>\n",
